WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.008
Guardian’s views build on your last scan: run a scan first, then open Guardian.

2
00:00:06.509 --> 00:00:13.363
Domains: for each host you see totals, broken links, 403s, redirects and a health score.

3
00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:21.942
Health / book: pages ranked by health, so you know where to start repairing.

4
00:00:27.315 --> 00:00:34.025
Trends: record the current run and compare it with an earlier session to see what is new and what was resolved.

5
00:00:35.673 --> 00:00:42.575
404 from logs: import an Apache or nginx log to learn which missing pages visitors really hit.

6
00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:49.545
Compliance: generate a report for a period, for example the last 30 days, from the saved history.

